<title>AUSTRALIA: SOCCER-BRISBANE BEAT SYDNEY 2-0 IN AUSTRALIAN FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BRISBANE BEAT SYDNEY 2-0 IN AUSTRALIAN FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE, Australia 1997-05-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brisbane Strikers beat Sydney United 2-0 (halftime 0-0) to win Australia's national soccer league final at Suncorp Stadium on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Brisbane - Frank Farina 47, Rod Brown 69.</p>
<p>Attendance: 40,446.</p>
</text>
